   "kind": 1,
   "value": "**Python result** (`verify_fused.py`, float, random twist): relative error 1e-16 to 3e-14 for k = 1..4 on chains A F, A F A F and F A. Single-pass form confirmed for all k, including $t_4$ = quantum determinant.",
