  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "## 2. Pair-vacuum annihilation pattern (task 3), symbolic",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "Module[{u, tA, tF, vac, S, ent, rhs, ok, pat},\n vac = pgProd[{pgUV[1], pgUV[4]}]; S = Sum[pgProd[{pgUV[i], pgUV[i]}], {i, 4}];\n ent[j_, k_] := Expand[Normal[vac . Sum[KroneckerProduct[pgLax[1, \"A\", u, tA][[j, m]], pgLax[1, \"F\", u, tF][[m, k]]], {m, 4}]]];\n rhs[j_, k_] := Expand[(u - tA) (u - tF) KroneckerDelta[j, k] vac - pgh (u - tA) KroneckerDelta[k, 4] pgProd[{pgUV[1], pgUV[j]}] +\n     pgh (u - tF) KroneckerDelta[j, 1] pgProd[{pgUV[k], pgUV[4]}] - pgh^2 KroneckerDelta[j, 1] KroneckerDelta[k, 4] S];\n ok = And @@ Flatten[Table[ent[j, k] === rhs[j, k], {j, 4}, {k, 4}]];\n pat = Table[Which[AllTrue[ent[j, k], # === 0 &], \"0\", AllTrue[ent[j, k] /. u -> tA, # === 0 &], \"0 at u=thA\",\n     AllTrue[ent[j, k] /. u -> tF, # === 0 &], \"0 at u=thF\", True, \"*\"], {j, 4}, {k, 4}];\n Grid[{{\"formula holds for all (j,k)\", ok}, {\"zero pattern of <e1 e4|(L_A L_F)_jk(u)\", Grid[pat, Frame -> All]}}, Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left]]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
