  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "**Python result** (`task1_scan.py`, `task1_struct.py`, exact):\n\n| operator | site | vector |\n|---|---|---|\n| $t_1(\\theta_2)$ | 2 (F) | $(0,0,-2263/14000,0)=h\\theta_{12}\\theta_{23}(\\theta_{24}-h)\\,e_4G_c$ |\n| $t_1(\\theta_3)$ | 3 (A) | $\\propto e_1G_c^T=(c_1,1,0,0)$ |\n| $t_3(\\theta_1-h)$ | 1 (A) | $\\propto e_1G_c^{-T}\\propto e_4$ |\n| $t_3(\\theta_4+3h)$ | 4 (F) | $\\propto e_4G_c^{-1}$ |\n\n**No** $t_2(\\theta_2+s)$ and **no** $t_3(\\theta_2+s)$ ($s=-3h..4h$) localises on site 2. $t_2(\\theta_2+h)$ excites sites $\\{2\\},\\{1,2\\},\\{2,3\\}$. $t_3(\\theta_2+3h)$ excites $\\{2\\},\\{3\\},\\{4\\},\\{2,3\\}$; in qKZ form it is $R_{21}\\tilde G_2^TR_{24}R_{23}$, a right-end operator, and it localises only at the last site. At the ABJM point $t_2(\\theta_2+h)$ excites only $\\{2\\},\\{1,2\\}$, i.e. pair 1.\n\nSo the requested F-site dictionary ($M_2$ quadratic, $M_3$ cubic on site 2) **does not exist at 4 sites**. The $\\wedge^k$ structure is carried by the pair (section 5), and $A_\\kappa F_\\kappa$ cannot be assembled from single-site factors. The same-point generating functions $\\sum_k c_kt_k(u_0)$ (all $k$ at one point, or the staircase $u_0+(k-1)h$, with $u_0\\in\\{\\theta_F+mh,\\theta_A+mh\\}$, $m=-3..4$) give no localising combination beyond the individually localising terms, at generic $\\theta$ or at the ABJM point (`samepoint.py`, three references at once).",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "## 5. The localised algebra on pair 1 at the ABJM point\n\nWords $\\prod t_k(\\theta_F+mh)$ on a random BPS reference at 4 sites. Each word is checked for localisation and for exact equality with $\\lambda\\times$(the 1-pair-chain word); the rank of the localised pair states is printed last.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "pgWords = {{}, {{1, 0}}, {{2, 1}}, {{3, 1}}, {{1, 0}, {3, 1}}, {{1, 0}, {1, 1}}, {{1, 0}, {3, 3}}, {{1, 2}, {3, 1}}, {{3, 1}, {3, 2}}};\npgLocRes = Module[{thF = -3/5, th, thP, ref, rest, ref2},\n   th = {thF + 1, thF, -3/8, -11/8}; thP = Take[th, 2];\n   ref = pgProd[{pgV0, pgU0, pgV0, pgU0}]; rest = pgProd[{pgV0, pgU0}]; ref2 = pgProd[{pgV0, pgU0}];\n   Table[Module[{wa = ({#[[1]], thF + #[[2]] pgh} & /@ w), full, pairw, sp, lam, j, r},\n     full = pgApplyWord[wa, ref, {\"A\", \"F\", \"A\", \"F\"}, th, pgG0];\n     pairw = Normal[pgApplyWord[wa, ref2, {\"A\", \"F\"}, thP, pgG0]];\n     sp = pgSplit[full, rest];\n     lam = Times @@ Table[pgLam[x[[1]], x[[2]], Drop[th, 2]], {x, wa}];\n     j = FirstPosition[pairw, _?(# != 0 &), None, {1}];\n     r = If[j === None, Indeterminate, sp[[1, j[[1]]]]/pairw[[j[[1]]]]];\n     {w, AllTrue[Flatten[sp[[2]]], TrueQ[# == 0] &], MatrixRank[{sp[[1]], pairw}] <= 1 && j =!= None, sp[[1]] == lam pairw, r/lam, sp[[1]]}], {w, pgWords}]];\nGrid[Join[{{\"word {{k, m}, ...}: product of t_k(thF + m h)\", \"localises on pair 1\", \"proportional to the 1-pair-chain word\", \"= (prod of lambda_k) x (1-pair-chain word)\", \"fitted constant / (prod of lambda_k)\"}},\n   pgLocRes[[All, 1 ;; 5]], {{\"rank of all localised pair states\", MatrixRank[pgLocRes[[All, 6]]], \"\", \"\", \"\"}}], Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
