\"vertical-separator\" style=\"height:14.4613em;border-right-width:0.04em;border-right-style:solid;margin:0 -0.02em;vertical-align:-6.9806em;\"></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.5em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:9.4806em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-7.3204em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:9.4806em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-12.1409em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:9.4806em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-16.9613em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:9.4806em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:6.9806em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div></div></div>",
