  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "**Python result** (`pair_sym.py`, sympy, exact). Pair states are written as $4\\times4$ matrices $M_{ij}$ (A index $i$, F index $j$).\n- $X_1=2h^2\\,e_1\\otimes e_4G-h^2G_{41}\\,S$.\n- $X_3=12h^5\\,(e_1\\,\\mathrm{cof}\\,G)\\otimes e_4$, i.e. the A site rotated by $\\det G\\,G^{-T}$.\n- $X_3X_1\\propto\\rho_{\\rm pair}(G^{-T})$.\n- $X_2=\\mp2h^4\\times$($2\\times2$ minors of $G$ with rows $\\{2,4\\}$ or $\\{3,4\\}$): column 1 is zero, and row 4 has only the $(4,4)$ entry $-2h^4(G[24;12]+G[34;13])$. There is no group form.\n\nThe only rank-one (product) elements of the span are $v(\\alpha+\\beta G^{-T})\\otimes u$ and $vG^{-T}\\otimes u(\\alpha+\\beta G)$. **No common rotation $\\rho_{\\rm pair}(1-\\kappa Y)$ exists for $Y\\in\\{G,G^T,G^{\\pm1},G^{-T}\\}$ on a reference with $uGv^T\\neq0$** (exact `solve` in `pair_rank1*.py`).\n\nEigenvalue picture, diagonal twist, on weight states $e_i\\otimes e_j$ ($i\\ne j$): $x_1=X_1/(2h^2)\\to z_j$, $x_2=-X_2/(2h^4)\\to z_j(e_1(z)-z_i-z_j)$, $x_3=X_3/(12h^5)\\to\\det\\Lambda/z_i$. The rotation $\\rho_{\\rm pair}(1-\\kappa\\Lambda)$ needs $(1-\\kappa z_i)/(1-\\kappa z_j)$ on the weight states and 1 on the zero-weight states. A generic reference sees 12 weight states and 4 zero-weight states, but the algebra is only 5-dim. **The obstruction is the goodness condition in the $\\kappa^1..\\kappa^3$ terms:** the derivation-type action would need A by $G^T$ ($t_1(\\theta_A)$) or F by $G^{-1}$ ($\\hat t_3(\\theta_F+3h)$), and both localise only on good references. In 2603's $\\wedge^2$ chain a single $t_+$ moves both halves of the site.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "## 6. $W_a$, ABJM point, $z_2=z_3=y$: the word, solved symbolically at pair level",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "Module[{z1, y, z4, a, kap, G, W, xs, c, tgt, sol, ap, th2 = {1, 0}},\n G = DiagonalMatrix[{z1, y, y, z4}];\n W = pgProd[pgW[a]];\n xs = {W, Normal[W . pgT[1, 0, {\"A\", \"F\"}, th2, G]], Normal[W . pgT[2, 1/2, {\"A\", \"F\"}, th2, G]], Normal[W . pgT[3, 1/2, {\"A\", \"F\"}, th2, G, True]]};\n AppendTo[xs, Normal[xs[[4]] . pgT[1, 0, {\"A\", \"F\"}, th2, G]]];\n ap = a (1 - kap z4)/(1 - kap z1);\n tgt = (1 - kap z1)^2 pgProd[pgW[ap]];\n sol = Solve[Thread[Together[Sum[c[i] xs[[i]], {i, 5}] - tgt] == 0], Array[c, 5]];\n pgPairSol = Factor[Array[c, 5] /. First[sol]];\n Grid[Transpose[{{\"c0 (word 1)\", \"c1 (X1 = t1(thF))\", \"c2 (X2 = t2(thF+h))\", \"c3 (X3 = t3^(thF+h))\", \"c4 (X3 X1)\"}, pgPairSol}], Frame -> All]]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
       "data": "<div class=\"wl-output-block\"><div class=\"wl-output-header\" style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;width:100%;min-height:22px;\" data-session-epoch=\"725118\" data-output-id=\"222\" data-out-n=\"41\" data-sub-idx=\"0\" data-output-format=\"WLLatex\" data-output-is-graphics=\"0\" data-cell-idx=\"23\" data-sub-start=\"0\" data-sub-end=\"9\"><span style=\"font-size:10px;color:#888;margin-right:8px;\">Out[41]=</span></div><div class=\"wl-output-content\"><div class=\"vscode-wolfram-wllatex-prerendered\" data-page-width-em=\"24\" data-latex-b64=\"\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:7.0874em;vertical-align:-3.2737em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:3.8137em;\"><span style=\"top:-5.7737em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:5.7737em;\"></span><span class=\"mtable\"><span class=\"vertical-separator\" style=\"height:7.0474em;border-right-width:0.04em;border-right-style:solid;margin:0 -0.02em;vertical-align:-3.2737em;\"></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"col-align-c\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:3.7737em;\"><span style=\"top:-5.8897em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.07em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">c0 (word 1)</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.6897em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.07em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">c1 (X1 = t1(thF))</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.3197em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.07em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">c2 (X2 = t2(thF+h))</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-1.8286em;\"><sp