  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "**Python result** (`negcontrols.py`, `span_exact4.py`, exact sympy ranks):\n\n| case | localised span | + target $\\rho_{\\rm pair}(1-\\kappa\\Lambda)$ |\n|---|---|---|\n| ABJM, $z_2=z_3$, $W_a$ | 5 (target inside, section 7) | 5 |\n| ABJM, $z_2\\neq z_3$, $W_a$ | 5 | **6** |\n| ABJM, $z_2=z_3$, generic BPS | 5 | **6** |\n| generic $\\theta$, $z_2=z_3$, $W_a$ | 4 | **5** |\n\nApplied to a generic BPS reference ($z_2=z_3$), the word $K$ gives an entangled pair state: the 4×4 pair matrix has rank 2, its trace is 0 (no singlet), and it is at relative distance 0.035 from $d_1d_4\\,\\rho_{\\rm pair}(D)(v\\otimes u)$.\n\n**Caveat on non-localising combinations** (`combo_search.py`, `combo_L3.py`, `sparse_generic.py`, numeric). Requiring the *same* coefficients for three values of $a$ is vacuous: the $a$-dependence factorises by weight. At L = 2 pairs, linear combinations of 253 words (singles and products of two) whose non-local parts cancel reach $W_{a'}\\otimes W_a$ in every case, the 2-pair algebra being too rich. At L = 3:\n- ABJM, $z_2\\ne z_3$: localised rank 5, target residual 2.3e-2, **fails**;\n- generic $\\theta$, $z_2\\ne z_3$: rank 4, **fails**;\n- ABJM, $z_2=z_3$: reaches the target;\n- generic $\\theta$, $z_2=z_3$: also reaches it, but the sparsest ($L^1$-minimal) combination has 80 words with coefficients from 1e-3 to 1e7, with no structure and unknown L-dependence.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "## 9. Untwisting limit (numeric)\n\nThe chain is the homogeneous ABJM chain, deformed with pairs preserved: $\\theta_{F,n}=\\varepsilon\\,\\vartheta_n$, $\\theta_{A,n}=\\theta_{F,n}+2h$, $\\vartheta=(0,0.37,-0.52)$, and $z=1+\\varepsilon\\phi$ with $\\phi=(0.9,0.35,0.35,-1.1)$, so $z_2=z_3$. The untwisted HW cyclic joint eigenstates are computed in place, which avoids loading `data/abjm-hw-states.wxf`. The twisted state is the eigenvector in the same weight sector with maximal overlap.\n- Mode \"vac\": $\\kappa=1/z_4$, $a=-1$; the target is $\\langle\\mathrm{vac}\\otimes W_{-1}^{L-1}|\\Psi_0\\rangle$.\n- Mode \"shift\": $a=1/3$ and $\\kappa=1/(z_1-a(z_1-z_4))\\to1$, so that $a'-a=-1$ exactly; the target is $\\langle\\mathrm{vac}^{L-1}\\otimes W_{-1}|\\Psi_0\\rangle$, via the HW trick with the finite shift $e^{-aE_{14}}$ and cyclicity.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "pgUntwist[Lp_, phi_, thdir_, epss_, mode_, a_] := Module[{N2 = 2 Lp, types, tuples, wt, sectors, perm, jop, th0, hw = {}, bFirst, bLast, rows = {}},\n   types = Flatten[Table[{\"A\", \"F\"}, Lp]];\n   tuples = Tuples[Range[4], N2];\n   wt[b_] := Total[MapThread[If[#2 == \"A\", 1, -1] UnitVector[4, #1] &, {b, types}]];\n   sectors = GroupBy[Range[4^N2], wt[tuples[[#]]] &];\n   perm = Table[FromDigits[Join[Drop[tuples[[n]], 2], Take[tuples[[n]], 2]] - 1, 4] + 1, {n, 4^N2}];\n   jop[i_, j_] := Sum[KroneckerProduct @@ Table[If[s == t, If[types[[s]] == \"A\", pgE[i, j], -pgE[j, i]], pgId4], {t, N2}], {s, N2}];\n   th0 = Flatten[Table[{1, 0}, Lp]];\n   With[{mg0 = N[pgT[1, 37/100, types, th0, IdentityMatrix[4]] + 61/100 pgT[3, -29/100, types, th0, IdentityMatrix[4]] + 23/100 pgT[2, 83/100, types, th0, IdentityMatrix[4]]],\n     j12 = jop[1, 2], j23 = jop[2, 3], j34 = jop[3, 4]},\n    Do[Module[{sec = sectors[w], d, cons, ns, bm, r, ev},\n       If[w[[1]] >= w[[2]] >= w[[3]] >= w[[4]],\n        d = Length[sec];\n        cons = Join[Normal[j12[[All, sec]]], Normal[j23[[All, sec]]], Normal[j34[[All, sec]]],\n          Table[Boole[perm[[sec[[q]]]] == sec[[p]]], {p, d}, {q, d}] - IdentityMatrix[d]];\n        ns = NullSpace[N[cons]];\n        If[ns =!= {},\n         bm = Transpose[ns]; r = LeastSquares[bm, Normal[mg0[[sec, sec]]] . bm]; ev = Eigenvectors[r];\n         Do[Module[{psi = ConstantArray[0. + 0. I, 4^N2], k},\n           psi[[sec]] = bm . v; psi = psi/Norm[psi]; k = Ordering[Abs[psi], -1][[1]]; psi = psi Abs[psi[[k]]]/psi[[k]];\n           AppendTo[hw, {w, sec, psi}]], {v, ev}]]]], {w, Keys[sectors]}]];\n   bFirst = pgProd[Join[{pgUV[1], pgUV[4]}, Flatten[Table[pgW[-1], Lp - 1], 1]]];\n   bLast = pgProd[Join[Flatten[Table[{pgUV[1], pgUV[4]}, Lp - 1], 1], pgW[-1]]];\n   Do[Module[{th = Flatten[Table[{eps thdir[[n]] + 1, eps thdir[[n]]}, {n, Lp}]], z = 1 + eps phi, G, y, u1, u2, l1, l2, l3, m1, m2, m3, mg},\n      G = DiagonalMatrix[z]; y = z[[2]]; u1 = th[[2]]; u2 = th[[2]] + pgh;\n      l1 = pgLam[1, u1, Drop[th, 2]]; l2 = pgLam[2, u2, Drop[th, 2]]; l3 = pgLam[3, u2, Drop[th, 2]];\n      m1 = N[pgT[1, u1, types, th, G]]; m2 = N[pgT[2, u2, types, th, G]]; m3 = N[pgT[3, u2, types, th, G, True]];\n      mg = N[pgT[1, 37/100, types, th, G] + 61/100 pgT[3, -29/100, types, th, G] + 23/100 pgT[2, 83/100, types, th, G]];\n      Do[Module[{w = st[[1]], sec = st[[2]], psi0 = st[[3]], es, best, psi, tau, t1, t2, t3, kap, s, kk, ap, ovW, rhs, lhs, tgt},\n         es = Eigenvectors[Normal[mg[[sec, sec]]]];\n         best = First[MaximalBy[es, Abs[Conjugate[#] . psi0[[sec]]]/Norm[#] &]];\n         psi = ConstantArray[0. + 0. I, 4^N2]; psi[[sec]] = best/Norm[best];\n         psi = psi Exp[-I Arg[Conjugate[psi0] . psi]];\n         tau[m_] := Conjugate[psi[[sec]]] . (Normal[m[[sec, sec]]] . psi[[sec]]);\n         t1 = tau[m1]; t2 = tau[m2]; t3 = tau[m3];\n         kap = If[mode == \"vac\", 1/z[[4]], 1/(z[[1]] - a (z[[1]] - z[[4]]))];\n         s = 1 - kap (z[[1]] + z[[4]]);\n         kk = s^2 + kap s (t1/(pgh^2 l1) + t2/(2 pgh^4 y l2) + t3/(6 pgh^5 y^2 l3)) + kap^2 t3 t1/(24 pgh^7 y^2 l1 l3);\n         ap = a (1 - kap z[[4]])/(1 - kap z[[1]]);\n         ovW = pgProd[Flatten[Table[pgW[a], Lp], 1]] . psi;\n         rhs = kk ovW/(1 - kap z[[1]])^2;\n         lhs = pgProd[Join[pgW[ap], Flatten[Table[pgW[a], Lp - 1], 1]]] . psi;\n         tgt = If[mode == \"vac\", bFirst, bLast] . psi0;\n         AppendTo[rows, {N[eps], w, Abs[Conjugate[psi0] . psi], Chop[rhs, 10^-12], Abs[rhs - lhs], Chop[tgt, 10^-12], Abs[rhs - tgt]}]], {st, hw}]], {eps, epss}];\n   rows];\npgHead = {\"eps\", \"weight\", \"|<Psi0|Psi_eps>|\", \"RHS = K(tau)<W_a^L|Psi>/(1-kappa z1)^2\", \"|RHS - LHS|\", \"target\", \"|RHS - target|\"};\npgUtVac = pgUntwist[2, {9/10, 7/20, 7/20, -11/10}, {0, 37/100}, {10^-2, 10^-3, 10^-4}, \"vac\", -1];\npgUtShift = pgUntwist[2, {9/10, 7/20, 7/20, -11/10}, {0, 37/100}, {10^-2, 10^-3, 10^-4}, \"shift\", 1/3];\nGrid[{{\"kappa = 1/z4, a = -1, target <vac (x) W_-1^(L-1)|Psi0>\"}, {Grid[Prepend[pgUtVac, pgHead], Frame -> All]},\n  {\"kappa -> 1 with a' - a = -1, a = 1/3, target <vac^(L-1) (x) W_-1|Psi0>\"}, {Grid[Prepend[pgUtShift, pgHead], Frame -> All]}}]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
