  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "## 10. Summary\n\n| item | result | evidence |\n|---|---|---|\n| fused $t_k$, $k=1..4$, single-pass $\\wedge^k$ form | equals the quantum minors | python numeric, 1e-15 |\n| pair-vacuum pattern | formula exact; 7 identical zeros, bonus at $\\theta_A$ / $\\theta_F$ | python exact (sympy) |\n| column-support lemma | pair 1 localises $t_1(\\theta_F)$, $\\hat t_3(\\theta_A-h)$, and **$t_2(\\theta_F+h)$ only at $\\theta_A-\\theta_F=2h$**, any twist and any rotation; action $=\\lambda_k\\times$1-pair word | derivation + python exact |\n| good-reference F-site dictionary ($M_2$, $M_3$) | does not exist at 4 sites; only $t_1(\\theta_2)\\to G$ on site 2 | python exact |\n| same-point generating functions | no new localising combinations | python numeric |\n| localised algebra on pair 1 | 5-dim at ABJM ($1,X_1,X_2,X_3,X_3X_1$), 4-dim otherwise; no common group rotation for generic references | python exact |\n| $W_a$, ABJM, $z_2\\neq z_3$ | fails, rank 5 vs 6 (zero-weight $E_{22}/E_{33}$ obstruction) | python exact |\n| **$W_a$, ABJM, $z_2=z_3$** | **exact 5-word formula $K_\\kappa$, $a$-independent, local (L = 2, 3)** | python exact |\n| untwisting, L = 2 and 3, both modes | converges $O(\\varepsilon)$ to the even-bridge $C$ for all HW states | python numeric |\n| non-localising combinations | reach the target at L = 2 always (not meaningful); at L = 3 only for $z_2=z_3$ | python numeric |\n\nOpen: (i) $z_2\\neq z_3$, which needs a 6th localising operator; none exists among $t_{1,2,3}$ products. (ii) The ℓ-pair generalisation, which needs the analogue of 2603's SoV determinant. (iii) Whether the 80-word generic-θ combination at $z_2=z_3$ is L-universal (L = 4 needed). (iv) The homogeneous-limit form of $\\lambda_k$; it is finite at the ABJM point once the zero factors are dropped.",
